/**
 * Favicon.gs
 * Branded favicon (FLCPC "F" monogram + attendance check).
 *
 * Apps Script sets the browser-tab favicon via HtmlOutput.setFaviconUrl(),
 * which requires a PUBLICLY HOSTED image URL — it rejects data: URIs with
 * "The favicon icon image type is not supported." So FAVICON_URL points at the
 * committed favicon.png served from GitHub raw.
 *
 * FAVICON_DATA_URI is still used for the <head> <link> tags in Index.html
 * (those DO accept data URIs) as a fallback / add-to-home-screen icon.
 *
 * To use your own icon, host a PNG/ICO anywhere public and set FAVICON_URL to
 * it (a raw GitHub URL, your own site, or a Google Drive "uc?export=view&id="
 * link all work). Source image: apps-script/favicon.png (64x64 PNG).
 */
